-- GenChem Ch11 (Oxidation-Reduction Reactions) — Batch 3 of 4: Disproportionation + Net Ionic Equations & Spectator Ions
-- 15 questions, all confidence >=4 (verified vs OpenStax Chemistry: Atoms First 2e Ch.7; every oxidation number, electron count, and balancing coefficient independently re-computed).
-- Cross-batch + cross-chapter deduped (esp. vs Ch4 Types-of-Reactions / Balancing-redox / Ions-Electrolytes); final dedup audit PASS (0 genuine conflicts) after a systematic recall-answer-leak sweep.
